"ṟavvē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றவ்","tr":"ṟav"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கருங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"கரும்","lemma":"கரும்","gloss":"black"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"black-trunked"},{"surface":"வேம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"வேம்பு","lemma":"வேம்பு","gloss":"neem tree"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the neem tree"},{"surface":"ஒண்பூ","parts":[{"text":"ஒண்பூ","lemma":"ஒண்பூ","gloss":"bright flowers"}],"gloss":"bright flowers","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யாணர்","parts":[{"text":"யாணர்","lemma":"யாணர்","gloss":"fresh beauty"}],"gloss":"fresh beauty"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"என்னை","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"me"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative suffix"}],"gloss":"me"},{"surface":"இன்றியும்","parts":[{"text":"இன்றி","lemma":"இன்றி","gloss":"without"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even without"},{"surface":"கழிவது","parts":[{"text":"கழி","lemma":"கழி","gloss":"to pass"},{"text":"வது","lemma":"வது","gloss":"it"}],"gloss":"will it pass away"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"clitic of emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆற்றயல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆற்றயல்","lemma":"ஆற்றயல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எழுந்த","parts":[{"text":"எழுந்த","lemma":"எழுந்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வெண்கோட்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கோட்","lemma":"வெண்கோட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டதவத்","parts":[{"text":"டதவத்","lemma":"டதவத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தெழுகுளிர்","parts":[{"text":"தெழுகுளிர்","lemma":"தெழுகுளிர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மிதித்த","parts":[{"text":"மிதித்த","lemma":"மிதித்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஒருபழம்","parts":[{"text":"ஒருபழம்","lemma":"ஒருபழம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"போலக்","parts":[{"text":"போலக்","lemma":"போலக்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"குழைய","parts":[{"text":"குழை","lemma":"குழை","gloss":"to be crushed"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"so as to be crushed"},{"surface":"கொடியோர்","parts":[{"text":"கொடி","lemma":"கொடி","gloss":"cruel"},{"text":"யோர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"people"}],"gloss":"of the cruel people"},{"surface":"நாவே","parts":[{"text":"நா","lemma":"நா","gloss":"tongue"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis clitic"}],"gloss":"the tongues indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"காதல்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"person"}],"gloss":"the lover"},{"surface":"அகல","parts":[{"text":"அகல்","lemma":"அகல்","gloss":"to depart"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"when he departed"},{"surface":"கல்லென்று","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"sound of clamor"},{"text":"என்று","lemma":"என்","gloss":"making"}],"gloss":"making a loud clamor"},{"surface":"அவ்வே","parts":[{"text":"அவ்","lemma":"அ","gloss":"those"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis clitic"}],"gloss":"became those"}]}],"literal":"The fresh beauty of the bright flowers of the black-trunked neem tree / will it pass away even without me? / On the white-branched fig tree that grew near the river bank, / like a single fruit stepped on by a crawling crab, / so as to be crushed, the tongues of the cruel people, / when my lover departed, made a loud clamor.","translation":"Will the fresh beauty of the bright flowers of the black-trunked neem tree pass away without me being with him? When my lover departed, the tongues of cruel people made a loud clamor, crushing my heart like a single fig fruit on the white-branched tree by the river bank, stepped on and squashed by a crawling crab.","modern":"கரிய அடிமரத்தைக் கொண்ட வேப்ப மரத்தின் பிரகாசமான பூக்களின் புதிய அழகு, என் காதலர் என்னுடன் இல்லாதபோதும் வீணாகக் கழிந்துவிடுமோ? ஆற்றின் கரையில் வளர்ந்த வெண்மையான கிளைகளைக் கொண்ட அத்தி மரத்தின் ஒரு பழத்தை, அங்கே ஊர்ந்து செல்லும் நண்டு மிதித்து நசுக்கியது போல, என் நெஞ்சம் நசுங்கி வருந்தும்படி, என் காதலர் என்னை விட்டுப் பிரிந்தபோது கொடியவர்களின் நாவுகள் அலர் தூற்றி ஆரவாரம் செய்தன.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her companion in the Mullai landscape, expressing her deep grief during her lover's absence. She laments that the beautiful neem flowers of the season are blooming and passing away without her being able to enjoy them with her lover. She compares her vulnerable state to a single fig fruit on a white-branched tree by the river bank, which is easily crushed when a crawling crab steps on it. In the same way, when her lover departed, the cruel gossip of the townspeople completely crushed her heart and made a loud, painful clamor. The image of the helpless fig fruit and the heavy crab perfectly captures her fragility and the destructive power of public gossip during her separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}